  "description": "Pasar Malam Sort by Zaib: a calm sorting puzzle at a cosy Malaysian night market. Move satay, kuih, ais kacang and more between the stalls, put three of a kind together to sell them and clear every stall. 60 levels in the Pasar Malam, Lantern Walk and Ramadan Bazaar, with free undo and hints. Free and kid friendly.",
